# Environment variables for tomation-webext

# Feature flag to enable the new typed messaging system
# Set to 'true' to use the new createMessenger() system with type safety
# Default: 'false' (uses webext-bridge for compatibility)
# 
# Benefits of new system:
# - Full TypeScript type safety for all messages
# - Explicit contracts for one-shot and channel messages
# - Smaller bundle size
# - MV3-safe patterns built in
#
# Migration path:
# 1. Set this to 'false' initially (default, uses webext-bridge)
# 2. Gradually test entrypoints with 'true' (new system)
# 3. Once all entrypoints are tested, deploy with 'true'
# 4. Remove webext-bridge dependency after migration
#
VITE_USE_NEW_MESSAGING='true'
